    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p style="text-align: left;"><strong>We have enabled infrastructure development across Africa for 6 decades.</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Our clients build incredible facilities, innovative energy projects, awe-inspiring roads and the next stage of the mining industry with confidence. Here is some of the work we have supported.</p>]]></Value>
